{
    "title": "Thermometer++",
    "description": "Most weather apps merely display data from the nearest weather station, which could be hundreds of kilometers away and more that an hour outdated. We utilize AI technologies to combine data from multiple weather stations, providing accurate predictions for temperature, humidity, and pressure at your current location in real-time.\r\n\r\nFeatures:\r\n\r\n - Shows temperature, humidity, and pressure. You can use it as a thermometer, barometer, or hygrometer.\r\n\r\n - Use your current location or choose any location on a map.\r\n\r\n - Minimalistic design: shows only the necessary data.\r\n\r\n - Displays Celsius and Fahrenheit degrees on a beautiful thermometer picture.\r\n\r\n - Switch between Celsius and Fahrenheit degrees with a tap.\r\n\r\n - Helps you quickly decide what to wear.\r\n\r\n - Helps you keep track of the weather during heat and cold waves.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Most weather apps merely display data from the nearest weather station, which could be hundreds of kilometers away and more that an hour outdated. We utilize AI technologies to combine data from multiple weather stations, providing accurate predictions for temperature, humidity, and pressure at your current location in real-time.<br><br>Features:<br><br> - Shows temperature, humidity, and pressure. You can use it as a thermometer, barometer, or hygrometer.<br><br> - Use your current location or choose any location on a map.<br><br> - Minimalistic design: shows only the necessary data.<br><br> - Displays Celsius and Fahrenheit degrees on a beautiful thermometer picture.<br><br> - Switch between Celsius and Fahrenheit degrees with a tap.<br><br> - Helps you quickly decide what to wear.<br><br> - Helps you keep track of the weather during heat and cold waves.",
